    <listEvent>
      <event xml:id="ev_stoker" notBefore="1908-06-14" notAfter="1908-06-16">
        <head>Stoker's knife attack aboard ship</head>
        <p>Mizuno: filed under 15 June, late at night after a fancy-dress ball; the senior stoker is stabbed. <ptr target="mizuno.xml#e1908-06-15"/></p>
        <p>Uetsuka: night of 14 June, after a farewell ceremony in the saloon; the blade is held to the deputy stoker's abdomen. Pointer to be added when uetsuka.xml is encoded.</p>
      </event>
      <event xml:id="ev_capetown" notBefore="1908-06-02" notAfter="1908-06-03">
        <head>Arrival at Cape Town</head>
        <p>Mizuno: anchored outside the harbour at 22:00 on 2 June; entered the dock at 07:00 on 3 June. <ptr target="mizuno.xml#e1908-06-02"/> <ptr target="mizuno.xml#e1908-06-03"/></p>
        <p>Uetsuka: African coast sighted early on 3 June; entered port at 23:00. Pointer to be added when uetsuka.xml is encoded.</p>
      </event>
    </listEvent>
